(text "DLATCH2_J2N16: two D latches, Qi = Di while E = 1, held while E = 0. 7 tubes: 2 x RSLATCH_J2N16 + one 6N16B.\nThe 6N16B inverts D1 and D2 (Ra 10k), each through a divider (2.7 pF, one pentode g1) to R of its latch.\nD pins: one pentode g1 + one triode grid (divider C1 2.7 + 3.9 pF). E: four g3 (4 x 6.8 pF). Outputs HV.\nA 16-tube board holds two of these (four latches) or two DFF_J2N16. Page: sch/logic/RSLATCH_J2N16/README.md" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 50.8 203.2 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "6099532e-dc31-48ac-96f4-41e91c5ea3a1"))

(embedded_fonts no))
